  innermost dimension (`axis=-1`). The operation will accept any number of
  outer dimensions. Here it is applied to the rows of a matrix:

  >>> sorted_sequence = [[0., 3., 8., 9., 10.],
  ...                    [1., 2., 3., 4., 5.]]
  >>> values = [[9.8, 2.1, 4.3],
  ...           [0.1, 6.6, 4.5, ]]
  >>> tf.searchsorted(sorted_sequence, values).numpy()
  array([[4, 1, 2],
