  on an edge:

  >>> seq = [0, 3, 9, 10, 10]
  >>> values = [0, 4, 10]
  >>> tf.searchsorted(seq, values).numpy()
  array([0, 2, 3], dtype=int32)
  >>> tf.searchsorted(seq, values, side="right").numpy()
